card.statement:
The map $D$ is a faithful homomorphism of groups:

\begin{equation}
D(g)D(f)=D(gf), D^*(g)=D(g^{-1}), D(e)=Id,g,f\in G.
\end{equation}

Furthermore,

\begin{equation}
D(g)\partial(\alpha)=\partial(\alpha\circ g),\bar{\partial}(\beta)D(g)=\bar{\partial}(\beta\circ g^{-1}),
\bar{\partial}(\beta)\partial(\alpha)=\sum\limits_{h\in G}\alpha(h)\beta(h),\alpha,\beta\in \mathcal{F}(G),g\in G.
\end{equation}
